

Eto sọ-di-mimọ.


>> Veggy := Nkan tuntun.
Veggy nigbati: ['tuntun'] ṣe: {
	>> v := ara-rẹ tuntun.
	v init. <- v.
}.

Veggy nigbati: ['init'] ṣe: { tirẹ veggies := 0. }.

Veggy nigbati: ['carrots:'] ṣe: { :a tirẹ veggies := a. <- Ofo. }.
Veggy nigbati: ['carrots'] ṣe: { <- tirẹ veggies. }.
Veggy nigbati: ['+'] ṣe: { :f
	>> n := Veggy tuntun.
	n carrots: (f carrots + tirẹ veggies). <- n.
}.

Veggy nigbati: ['ọrọ'] ṣe: { <- tirẹ veggies ọrọ.
}.

Nọmba nigbati: ['carrots'] ṣe: {
	>> x := Veggy tuntun.
	x carrots: ara-rẹ. <- x.
}.

Nọmba nigbati: ['add:and:'] ṣe: { :a :b <- (a + b).
}.

>> q := 0 add: (3 carrots + 2 carrots) and: 4 carrots.
Ijade kọ: q, ila-tuntun.
